Absolutely.
绝对是的。

00:26:58.380 --> 00:27:06.740
But she's also like when you're in your 20s, when you're in your 20s, I think it can be really dangerous actually to have too much success in your 20s.
但这也是因为当你处于20多岁的年纪时，当你在20多岁的时候，我其实觉得在20多岁取得过多的成功可能会非常危险。

00:27:06.740 --> 00:27:11.819
Like your 20s are a time of like building, right?
20多岁是一个建设的时期，对吧？

00:27:11.819 --> 00:27:14.646
it's foundational, you're putting the scaffolding up.
这是打地基的阶段，你正在搭建脚手架。

00:27:14.646 --> 00:27:22.699
But sometimes when you get too big for your bridges in your 20s, it can be very hard to sustain and you get, you know, you're always chasing something.
但有时如果你在20多岁时自我膨胀得太厉害，就很难维持下去，你会发现自己，你知道的，总是在盲目追逐着什么。

