It's, um, but there, but I thought there was something fun about her wanting to feel special and wanting to feel like really someone who could get her friends into this club.
这是一个……不过，我觉得有趣的是，她想要觉得自己很特别，想要觉得自己真的有能力把朋友带进这家俱乐部。

