我觉得对于她们和罗宾来说，这一集里有太多精彩的内容了。

00:27:53.593 --> 00:27:56.249
Each week, I do like to give a note and I'd regret.
每周我都会习惯性地做个记录，然后感到遗憾。

00:27:56.249 --> 00:28:05.259
And I do regret now just saying it out loud that we didn't tie Robin's like newfound celebrity status in this episode to falling in the horse poop from the previous episode.
现在我也很遗憾，当时居然没有大声说出来：我们没有把罗宾在这集里新获得的明星身份和上一集掉进马粪的事联系起来。

00:28:05.259 --> 00:28:26.230
We didn't really connect those two things as much as we could up because it's how it feels right She kind of became a little more known from that and so now they got around this guest list But we don't ever say that.
我们本可以把这两件事联系得更紧密一些，因为那样感觉才对，对吧？她因为那件事变得稍微有点名气了，所以现在他们才能绕过那份嘉宾名单，但我们从来没明说这一点。

00:28:26.230 --> 00:28:48.171
I don't know if there's any draft in which we did but I'm just gonna give notes to pass Elves as we go through this And now commercials and of commercials back to show Robins from Canada Ted from Ohio Marshalls from Minnesota.
