So this episode made me think about something that comes up with patients all the time, which is that we graduate high school together, we graduate college together, and then after that everyone moves through developmental phases at very different times, so some people get married and have kids pretty young, others, it takes some time to find the right person to do that with.
所以这一集让我想起了一个在患者中经常出现的问题，那就是我们一起高中毕业，一起大学毕业，然后在那之后，每个人以非常不同的节奏经历人生的各个发展阶段，所以有些人很年轻就结婚生子了，而另一些人则需要花一些时间才能找到合适的人去做这件事。

00:34:57.422 --> 00:35:03.280
That could be really hard on friendships even if you're physically very close to somebody.
