00:46:14.166 --> 00:46:19.095
And the first thing I did today when dealing with a lot of stress was put on an episode of how I met your mother.
今天面对巨大压力时，我做的第一件事就是播放一集《老爸老妈的浪漫史》。

00:46:19.095 --> 00:46:28.124
Because even when I'm dealing with things that make me want to do nothing but crawl up on a ball and cry, I can put on this show and it can bring a smile to my face when it's very hard for anything else too.
因为即使当我面对那些只想让我蜷缩成一团哭泣的事情时，我只要打开这部剧，它就能让我的脸上露出笑容，而其他任何东西都很难做到这一点。

00:46:28.124 --> 00:46:33.619
I just wanted you guys to know you made a great show and this will be the first podcast I'll ever pay attention to in my life.
我只是想让你们知道，你们制作了一部伟大的剧集，这将是我一生中唯一关注的播客。

00:46:33.619 --> 00:46:34.848
Take that smart list.
学着点吧，SmartLess。

00:46:34.848 --> 00:46:43.619
Thank you guys very much for doing this and making a great show that even in the darkest days can still bring out a little smile and nothing else can.
非常感谢你们制作这个节目，并创作了一部即使在最黑暗的日子里也能让人露出一丝微笑、而其他一切都做不到的伟大剧集。

00:46:43.619 --> 00:46:45.619
How nice is that to hear Josh?
听到这个感觉多好啊，乔希？

00:46:45.619 --> 00:46:48.619
Boy, he really has no interest in podcasts.
天哪，他是真的对播客一点兴趣都没有。

00:46:48.619 --> 00:46:53.619
No, just trying three times over to shit on podcasts for no reason.
不，他只是变着法儿地无缘无故贬低播客三次。

00:46:53.619 --> 00:46:57.619
But it's almost like how he made your mother's a good sitcom for people who don't like sitcoms.
但这有点像《老爸老妈的浪漫史》对于那些不喜欢情景喜剧的人来说，是一部很好的情景喜剧。

00:46:57.619 --> 00:47:04.500
Oh, well, oh boy, you know, my head's not there, it's not going to be better than that.
好吧，哦天哪，你知道的，我的脑子不在状态，不可能说得比这更好了。

00:47:04.500 --> 00:47:06.500
My drop boom.
我的底牌，炸裂。

00:47:06.500 --> 00:47:15.530
I am guilty, please equip me, all sins are forgiven, New York City.
我有罪，请判我有罪，所有的罪孽都被原谅，纽约市。

00:47:15.530 --> 00:47:20.610
How we made your mother is hosted and executive produced by Josh Radner and Craig Thomas.
《老爸老妈是如何诞生的》由乔希·拉德纳（Josh Radner）和克雷格·托马斯（Craig Thomas）主持并担任执行制片人。

